NOTICE REGARDING SIMULATED MEDICAL DATA

This software generates synthetic (simulated) patient data. It contains no real
patient information and is not a medical device. Outputs are trial-design
decision support artefacts only and must not be used as clinical evidence, as
medical advice, or as a regulatory submission. Population priors, drug
parameters and adverse-event models bundled with the repository are
illustrative and require validation against licensed reference data before any
regulated use.
